gpu_frame_stats on Vulkan: the time the GPU command thread spends in EndSubmission, in its synchronous command buffer
replay and vkQueueSubmit, and in IssueSwap (which includes the frame's last EndSubmission) is logged per frame every
10 s next to IssueDraw's, so the thread's time outside IssueDraw splits into submission work and PM4 processing.

diff --git a/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h b/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h
